      "preview": "זֵ֫כֶר: lembrança, memória, memorial, renome.",
      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">זֵ֫כֶר</span></big>  <strong>substantivo masculino.</strong> <sup>ψ 9:7</sup> <strong>lembrança, memorial (</strong>cf. Hpt<sup>Hbr</sup>. <sup>1885, 230</sup><strong>)</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">ז׳</span> absoluto <a data-ref=\"Psalms 111:4\" href=\"/Psalms.111.4\">ψ 111:4</a>, construto <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 25:19\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.25.19\">Dt 25:19</a> +; <span dir=\"rtl\">זֶכֶר</span> construto <a data-ref=\"Exodus 17:14\" href=\"/Exodus.17.14\">Ex 17:14</a> van d. H; com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">זִכְרִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 3:15\" href=\"/Exodus.3.15\">Ex 3:15</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">זִכְרְךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 26:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.26.8\">Is 26:8</a> +, <span dir=\"rtl\">זִכְרֶ֑ךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 6:6\" href=\"/Psalms.6.6\">ψ 6:6</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">זִכְרוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 12:6\" href=\"/Hosea.12.6\">Ho 12:6</a> +, <span dir=\"rtl\">זִכְרָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 32:26\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.32.26\">Dt 32:26</a> +:—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>lembrança, memória:</em> <strong>a.</strong>  de pessoas ou de povo, apagada pela destruição deles, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 17:14\" href=\"/Exodus.17.14\">Ex 17:14</a> (E; com <span dir=\"rtl\">מחה</span>) = <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 25:19\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.25.19\">Dt 25:19</a>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 32:26\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.32.26\">Dt 32:26</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(השׁבית)</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 34:17\" href=\"/Psalms.34.17\">ψ 34:17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 109:15\" href=\"/Psalms.109.15\">109:15</a> (ambos <span dir=\"rtl\">הכרית</span>), <a data-ref=\"Psalms 9:7\" href=\"/Psalms.9.7\">ψ 9:7</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(אבד)</span>, <a data-ref=\"Job 18:17\" href=\"/Job.18.17\">Jb 18:17</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">אבד</span>; ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">שֵׁם</span>), <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 26:14\" href=\"/Isaiah.26.14\">Is 26:14</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(אבּד)</span>; cf. por outro lado <span dir=\"rtl\">ז׳ עוֹלָם</span> como porção dos justos <a data-ref=\"Psalms 112:6\" href=\"/Psalms.112.6\">ψ 112:6</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  de <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 6:6\" href=\"/Psalms.6.6\">ψ 6:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 102:13\" href=\"/Psalms.102.13\">102:13</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אַתָּה</span> = <span dir=\"rtl\">יהוה</span>). <strong>c.</strong>  do caráter e obras de <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 30:5\" href=\"/Psalms.30.5\">ψ 30:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 97:12\" href=\"/Psalms.97.12\">97:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 111:4\" href=\"/Psalms.111.4\">111:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 145:7\" href=\"/Psalms.145.7\">145:7</a>. <strong>d.</strong>  <em>lembrança</em> de certos dias, isto é, sua observância <a data-ref=\"Esther 9:28\" href=\"/Esther.9.28\">Est 9:28</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(יִמֵי הַפּוּרִים)</span>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>memorial</em>, pelo qual alguém é lembrado: <strong>a.</strong>  quase = <span dir=\"rtl\">שֵׁם</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ז׳ צַדִּיק לִבְרָכָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 10:7\" href=\"/Proverbs.10.7\">Pr 10:7</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">שֵׁם</span>), cf. também <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 9:5\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.9.5\">Ec 9:5</a> (com <span dir=\"rtl\">נשׁכח</span>); especialmente de <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 3:15\" href=\"/Exodus.3.15\">Ex 3:15</a> (E), <a data-ref=\"Hosea 12:6\" href=\"/Hosea.12.6\">Ho 12:6</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 26:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.26.8\">Is 26:8</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 135:13\" href=\"/Psalms.135.13\">ψ 135:13</a> (todos ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">שֵׁם</span>). <strong>b.</strong>  = renome (de Israel) <a data-ref=\"Hosea 14:8\" href=\"/Hosea.14.8\">Ho 14:8</a> (cf. VB).",
