      "preview": "זָכָר: substantivo e adjetivo: macho, masculino.",
      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">זָכָר</span></big>  <strong>substantivo masculino.</strong> e <strong>adjetivo: macho, masculino (</strong>assírio <em>zikaru, zikru</em>, COT<sup>Gloss</sup> Lyon <sup>Manual, Gloss;</sup> árabe <span dir=\"rtl\">ذَكَرٌ</span>; aramaico <span dir=\"rtl\">דִּכְרָא</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܕܶܟܪܳܐ</span>; sabeu <span dir=\"rtl\">דֿ[כ]רם</span> DHM<sup>ZMG 1876, 675</sup>; relação com a raiz acima obscura; macho como <em>mencionado, de quem se fala</em>, Lane<sup>969 f.</sup>; do suposto sentido original <em>ser agudo</em> (vestígios disto em árabe: ver Lane), Bö<sup>Prob 207</sup> Fl em ChWB <sup>i, 422</sup>, cf. árabe <span dir=\"rtl\">ذَكَرٌ</span> <em>órgão masculino</em>; Schwally<sup>ZAW 1891, 176 ff.</sup> de <span dir=\"rtl\">זָכַר</span> = <em>invocar</em> no culto; daí <em>macho</em> como <em>apto a prestar culto</em>. (Contra a opinião de Schwally, ver JPeritz<sup>Woman in the Ancient Hebrew Cult, JBL xvii (1898), 111 ff.</sup>).<strong>)</strong> —sempre absoluto <span dir=\"rtl\">ז׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 1:27\" href=\"/Genesis.1.27\">Gn 1:27</a> +; plural <span dir=\"rtl\">(ה)זְכָרִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 13:12\" href=\"/Exodus.13.12\">Ex 13:12</a> +; ver também [<a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, זָכוּר\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_זָכוּר\">זָכוּר</a>]:—<br><strong>I.</strong>  substantivo <em>macho</em>, descendência de homens e animais <a data-ref=\"Exodus 13:12\" href=\"/Exodus.13.12\">Ex 13:12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 13:15\" href=\"/Exodus.13.15\">15</a> (plural, ambos JE); oposto a <span dir=\"rtl\">נְקֵבָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 4:16\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.4.16\">Dt 4:16</a>; especificamente <strong>1.</strong>  de homens: <strong>a.</strong>  na expressão <span dir=\"rtl\">אשׁר לא יָֽדְעָה אישׁ לְמִשְׁכַב זָכָר</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 21:12\" href=\"/Judges.21.12\">Ju 21:12</a> (Bu<sup>RS 153</sup> Dr<sup>Intr. 151</sup>), cf. v. <a data-ref=\"Judges 21:11\" href=\"/Judges.21.11\">11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 31:17\" href=\"/Numbers.31.17\">Nu 31:17</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 31:18\" href=\"/Numbers.31.18\">18</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 31:35\" href=\"/Numbers.31.35\">35</a> (todos os três P); <span dir=\"rtl\">צַלְמֵי זָכָר</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 16:17\" href=\"/Ezekiel.16.17\">Ez 16:17</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  isoladamente = <em>homem</em> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 30:6\" href=\"/Jeremiah.30.6\">Je 30:6</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">רְאוּ אִם־יֹלֵד זָכָ֑ר</span>, ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">גֶּבֶר</span>); geralmente coletivo, <em>homens, pessoas do sexo masculino</em> (de todas as idades) <a data-ref=\"Judges 21:11\" href=\"/Judges.21.11\">Ju 21:11</a> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 11:15\" href=\"/I_Kings.11.15\">1 K 11:15</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 11:16\" href=\"/I_Kings.11.16\">16</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 34:25\" href=\"/Genesis.34.25\">Gn 34:25</a> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 6:11\" href=\"/Leviticus.6.11\">Lv 6:11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 6:22\" href=\"/Leviticus.6.22\">22</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 7:6\" href=\"/Leviticus.7.6\">7:6</a> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 1:2\" href=\"/Numbers.1.2\">Nu 1:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 1:20\" href=\"/Numbers.1.20\">20</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 1:22\" href=\"/Numbers.1.22\">22</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 3:28\" href=\"/Numbers.3.28\">3:28</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 3:34\" href=\"/Numbers.3.34\">34</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 3:39\" href=\"/Numbers.3.39\">39</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 18:10\" href=\"/Numbers.18.10\">18:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 26:62\" href=\"/Numbers.26.62\">26:62</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 31:7\" href=\"/Numbers.31.7\">31:7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 31:17\" href=\"/Numbers.31.17\">17</a> (todos P); plural <span dir=\"rtl\">(ה)זכרים</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 31:16\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.31.16\">2 Ch 31:16</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 8:3\" href=\"/Ezra.8.3\">Ezr 8:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 8:4\" href=\"/Ezra.8.4\">4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 8:5\" href=\"/Ezra.8.5\">5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 8:6\" href=\"/Ezra.8.6\">6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 8:7\" href=\"/Ezra.8.7\">7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 8:8\" href=\"/Ezra.8.8\">8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 8:9\" href=\"/Ezra.8.9\">9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 8:10\" href=\"/Ezra.8.10\">10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 8:11\" href=\"/Ezra.8.11\">11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 8:12\" href=\"/Ezra.8.12\">12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 8:13\" href=\"/Ezra.8.13\">13</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 8:14\" href=\"/Ezra.8.14\">14</a>, assim também <a data-ref=\"Joshua 5:4\" href=\"/Joshua.5.4\">Jos 5:4</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">כל־העם</span>, e <span dir=\"rtl\">כל־אנשׁי המלחמה</span>), <a data-ref=\"Joshua 17:2\" href=\"/Joshua.17.2\">17:2</a> (glosa? cf. Dr<sup>Intr. 104</sup>); especialmente de indivíduo, em conexão com a circuncisão <a data-ref=\"Genesis 17:10\" href=\"/Genesis.17.10\">Gn 17:10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 17:12\" href=\"/Genesis.17.12\">12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 17:14\" href=\"/Genesis.17.14\">14</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 17:23\" href=\"/Genesis.17.23\">23</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 34:15\" href=\"/Genesis.34.15\">34:15</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 34:22\" href=\"/Genesis.34.22\">22</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 34:24\" href=\"/Genesis.34.24\">24</a> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 12:48\" href=\"/Exodus.12.48\">Ex 12:48</a> (todos P); de criança do sexo masculino <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 12:2\" href=\"/Leviticus.12.2\">Lv 12:2</a> (P) <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 66:7\" href=\"/Isaiah.66.7\">Is 66:7</a>; oposto a <span dir=\"rtl\">נְקֵבָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 1:27\" href=\"/Genesis.1.27\">Gn 1:27</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 5:2\" href=\"/Genesis.5.2\">5:2</a> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 12:7\" href=\"/Leviticus.12.7\">Lv 12:7</a> (criança) <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 15:33\" href=\"/Leviticus.15.33\">15:33</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 27:3\" href=\"/Leviticus.27.3\">27:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 27:5\" href=\"/Leviticus.27.5\">5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 27:6\" href=\"/Leviticus.27.6\">6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 27:7\" href=\"/Leviticus.27.7\">7</a> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 5:3\" href=\"/Numbers.5.3\">Nu 5:3</a> (todos P; cf. sabeu <span dir=\"rtl\">אנתֿים פאו דֿ(כ)רם</span> DHM<sup>l.c.</sup>); oposto a <span dir=\"rtl\">אִשָּׁה</span> no mandamento contra a sodomia <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 18:22\" href=\"/Leviticus.18.22\">Lv 18:22</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 20:13\" href=\"/Leviticus.20.13\">20:13</a> (ambos H). <strong>2.</strong>  de animais, especialmente para sacrifício <a data-ref=\"Exodus 34:19\" href=\"/Exodus.34.19\">Ex 34:19</a> (JE; leia-se <span dir=\"rtl\">הַזָּכָר</span> pelo texto massorético <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּזָּכָר</span>); <a data-ref=\"Exodus 12:5\" href=\"/Exodus.12.5\">Ex 12:5</a> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 1:3\" href=\"/Leviticus.1.3\">Lv 1:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 1:10\" href=\"/Leviticus.1.10\">10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 4:23\" href=\"/Leviticus.4.23\">4:23</a> (todos P) <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 22:19\" href=\"/Leviticus.22.19\">22:19</a> (H), <a data-ref=\"Malachi 1:14\" href=\"/Malachi.1.14\">Mal 1:14</a>; oposto a <span dir=\"rtl\">נְקֵבָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 6:19\" href=\"/Genesis.6.19\">Gn 6:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 7:3\" href=\"/Genesis.7.3\">7:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 7:9\" href=\"/Genesis.7.9\">9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 7:16\" href=\"/Genesis.7.16\">16</a> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 3:1\" href=\"/Leviticus.3.1\">Lv 3:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 3:6\" href=\"/Leviticus.3.6\">6</a> (todos P)<br><strong>II.</strong>  adjetivo singular <em>masculino</em> (somente de seres humanos) <span dir=\"rtl\">יֻלַּד־לְךָ בֵּן ז׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 20:15\" href=\"/Jeremiah.20.15\">Je 20:15</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">כָּל־בְּכֹר ז׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 3:40\" href=\"/Numbers.3.40\">Nu 3:40</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 3:43\" href=\"/Numbers.3.43\">43</a> (ambos P).",
