      "html": "† II. <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">זָלַל</span>]</big></big>  <strong>verbo: 1. ser leve, sem valor</strong>, <strong>2. fazer pouco caso de (</strong>assírio <em>zalâlu</em>, <em>estar em ruínas</em>, COT<sup>Gloss</sup> (Asrn<sup>Standard Inscr. 15</sup>), árabe <span dir=\"rtl\">ذَلَّ</span> = aramaico <span dir=\"rtl\">ܕܰܠ</span> (raro), <span dir=\"rtl\">ܕܠܻܝܠܴܐ</span> <em>fácil;</em> mas <span dir=\"rtl\">זְלַל</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܙܰܠ</span>, são mais comuns (todos intransitivos)<strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  somente particípio ativo <span dir=\"rtl\">זוֹלֵל</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 21:20\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.21.20\">Dt 21:20</a> + 2 vezes; <span dir=\"rtl\">זוֹלֵלָ֑ה</span> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 1:11\" href=\"/Lamentations.1.11\">La 1:11</a>; plural <span dir=\"rtl\">זוֹלְלִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 28:7\" href=\"/Proverbs.28.7\">Pr 28:7</a>, construto <span dir=\"rtl\">זֹלְלֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 23:20\" href=\"/Proverbs.23.20\">Pr 23:20</a>— <strong>1.</strong>  <em>ser sem valor, insignificante</em> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 15:19\" href=\"/Jeremiah.15.19\">Je 15:19</a> (oposto a <span dir=\"rtl\">יָקָר</span>) <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 1:11\" href=\"/Lamentations.1.11\">La 1:11</a> (de Jerusalém em aflição). <strong>2.</strong>  transitivo <em>fazer pouco caso de</em> = <em>ser pródigo com, dissipar</em> (cf. II. <a data-ref=\"BDB, זוּל\" href=\"/BDB,_זוּל\", dir=\"rtl\">זוּל</a>), especialmente de glutonaria <span dir=\"rtl\">ז׳ בשׂר</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 23:20\" href=\"/Proverbs.23.20\">Pr 23:20</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">סֹבְאֵי יַיִן</span>), absoluto v. <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 23:21\" href=\"/Proverbs.23.21\">21</a> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 21:20\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.21.20\">Dt 21:20</a> (ambos ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">סֹבֵא</span>), <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 28:7\" href=\"/Proverbs.28.7\">Pr 28:7</a>.<br><strong>Hifil.</strong>  Perfeito com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">הִזִּילוּהָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 1:8\" href=\"/Lamentations.1.8\">La 1:8</a> causativo de <strong>Qal 1</strong> <em>fazer pouco caso de, desprezar</em> (oposto a <span dir=\"rtl\">כִּבֵּד</span>); sobre a forma, cf. Ges<sup>§ 67, R. 8</sup> RobGes, MV SS (menos preferível a atribuição a <span dir=\"rtl\">זוּל</span> por Thes Kö<sup>Lgb. i. 471</sup>).",
