      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">זַלְעָפָה</span></big>  <strong>substantivo feminino: calor abrasador (</strong>sobre a formação, cf. Ges<sup>Lbg 863</sup> Ol<sup>§ 196 a. 1. 2</sup><strong>)</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">ז׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 119:53\" href=\"/Psalms.119.53\">ψ 119:53</a>; plural absoluto <span dir=\"rtl\">זִלְעָפוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 11:6\" href=\"/Psalms.11.6\">ψ 11:6</a>; construto <span dir=\"rtl\">זִלְעֲפוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 5:10\" href=\"/Lamentations.5.10\">La 5:10</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  do calor febril da fome <span dir=\"rtl\">ז׳ רָעָב</span> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 5:10\" href=\"/Lamentations.5.10\">La 5:10</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  de vento abrasador <span dir=\"rtl\">רוּח ז׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 11:6\" href=\"/Psalms.11.6\">ψ 11:6</a> (na figura do juízo de <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>, com <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵשׁ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּפְרִית</span>).<br><strong>3.</strong>  figuradamente de zelo <span dir=\"rtl\">ז׳ אֲחָזַתְנִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 119:53\" href=\"/Psalms.119.53\">ψ 119:53</a>.",
