      "preview": "זִמָּה: plano, desígnio, iniquidade.",
      "html": "† I. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">זִמָּה</span></big>  <strong>substantivo feminino: plano, desígnio, iniquidade</strong>—absoluto <span dir=\"rtl\">ז׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 18:17\" href=\"/Leviticus.18.17\">Lv 18:17</a> + 17 vezes; construto <span dir=\"rtl\">זִמַּת</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 24:9\" href=\"/Proverbs.24.9\">Pr 24:9</a> + 2 vezes; com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">זִמָּתֵךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 16:58\" href=\"/Ezekiel.16.58\">Ez 16:58</a> + 3 vezes; <span dir=\"rtl\">זִמַּתְכֶ֫נָֿה</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 23:48\" href=\"/Ezekiel.23.48\">Ez 23:48</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 23:49\" href=\"/Ezekiel.23.49\">49</a>; plural <span dir=\"rtl\">זִמּוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 32:7\" href=\"/Isaiah.32.7\">Is 32:7</a>, com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">זִמֹּתַי</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 17:11\" href=\"/Job.17.11\">Jb 17:11</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>plano, propósito</em> <a data-ref=\"Job 17:11\" href=\"/Job.17.11\">Jb 17:11</a>; em outros lugares sempre<br><strong>2.</strong>  em sentido mau: <strong>a.</strong>  <em>desígnio maligno</em> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 32:7\" href=\"/Isaiah.32.7\">Is 32:7</a> (com <span dir=\"rtl\">יעץ</span>, seguido de <span dir=\"rtl\">לְחַבֵּל</span>); <span dir=\"rtl\">זִמַּת אִוֶּלֶת</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 24:9\" href=\"/Proverbs.24.9\">Pr 24:9</a>; cf. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 26:10\" href=\"/Psalms.26.10\">ψ 26:10</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">שֹׁחַד</span>), <a data-ref=\"Psalms 119:150\" href=\"/Psalms.119.150\">119:150</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  <em>iniquidade</em> em ato <span dir=\"rtl\">עשׂה ז׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 6:9\" href=\"/Hosea.6.9\">Ho 6:9</a> (onde há homicídio no contexto), <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 10:23\" href=\"/Proverbs.10.23\">Pr 10:23</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 21:27\" href=\"/Proverbs.21.27\">21:27</a> cf. Now. Especialmente <strong>c.</strong>  de impudicícia: incesto <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 18:17\" href=\"/Leviticus.18.17\">Lv 18:17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 20:14\" href=\"/Leviticus.20.14\">20:14</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, licenciosidade <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 19:29\" href=\"/Leviticus.19.29\">19:29</a> (todos H), <a data-ref=\"Judges 20:6\" href=\"/Judges.20.6\">Ju 20:6</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">נְבָלָה</span>), adultério <a data-ref=\"Job 31:11\" href=\"/Job.31.11\">Jb 31:11</a>; frequentemente (sobretudo Ezequiel) metaforicamente da idolatria do povo sob a figura de prostituição e adultério <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 13:27\" href=\"/Jeremiah.13.27\">Je 13:27</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(זִמַּת זְנוּתֵךְ)</span>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 16:27\" href=\"/Ezekiel.16.27\">Ez 16:27</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(דַּרְכֵּךְ זִמָּה)</span>, v. <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 16:43\" href=\"/Ezekiel.16.43\">43</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 16:58\" href=\"/Ezekiel.16.58\">58</a> (ambos ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">תּוֹעֵבָה</span>), <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 22:9\" href=\"/Ezekiel.22.9\">22:9</a> (com <span dir=\"rtl\">עשׂה</span>), v. <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 16:11\" href=\"/Ezekiel.16.11\">11</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">טִמֵּא בְּזִמָּה</span>, ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">תועבה</span>), <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 23:21\" href=\"/Ezekiel.23.21\">23:21</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 23:27\" href=\"/Ezekiel.23.27\">27</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">זְנוּתֵךְ</span>), v. <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 16:29\" href=\"/Ezekiel.16.29\">29</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(עֶרְוַת זְנוּנַיִךְ וְזִמָּתֵךְ וְתַזְנוּתָ֑יִךְ)</span>, v. <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 16:35\" href=\"/Ezekiel.16.35\">35</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">תַּזְנוּתָ֑יִךְ</span>), v. <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 16:44\" href=\"/Ezekiel.16.44\">44</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">אִשּׁוֹת הַזּ׳</span>, Co <span dir=\"rtl\">לעשׂות ז׳</span>), v. <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 16:48\" href=\"/Ezekiel.16.48\">48</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 16:49\" href=\"/Ezekiel.16.49\">49</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲטָאֵי גִלּוּלֵיכֶן</span>), <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 24:13\" href=\"/Ezekiel.24.13\">24:13</a>. [Em <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 16:27\" href=\"/Ezekiel.16.27\">Ez 16:27</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 16:43\" href=\"/Ezekiel.16.43\">43</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 24:13\" href=\"/Ezekiel.24.13\">24:13</a> suprimidos por Co, principalmente por razões internas.]",
