      "preview": "מְזִמָּה: propósito, discernimento, desígnio.",
      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מְזִמָּה</span></big>  <strong>substantivo feminino: propósito, discernimento, desígnio</strong> (Jeremias e literatura sapiencial), <span dir=\"rtl\">מְזִמָּה</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 42:2\" href=\"/Job.42.2\">Jb 42:2</a> + 5 vezes; <span dir=\"rtl\">הַמְּזִמָּ֫תָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 11:15\" href=\"/Jeremiah.11.15\">Je 11:15</a> (mas leia-se em lugar de <span dir=\"rtl\">המ׳ רַבִּים</span> com 𝔊 <span dir=\"rtl\">הַמְּזִמֹּת הַֽנְדָרִים</span>); inteiramente <span dir=\"rtl\">עָֽשְׂתָה מְזִמֹּת הַֽנְדָרִים וּבְשַׂר קֹדֶשׁ יַעֲבִרוּ מֵעָלַיִךְ רָעָתֵךְ</span>. <span dir=\"rtl\">מְזִמָּתוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 51:11\" href=\"/Jeremiah.51.11\">Je 51:11</a>; plural absoluto <span dir=\"rtl\">מְזִמּוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 37:7\" href=\"/Psalms.37.7\">ψ 37:7</a> + 7 vezes; construto <em>idem</em> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 23:20\" href=\"/Jeremiah.23.20\">Je 23:20</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 30:24\" href=\"/Jeremiah.30.24\">30:24</a>; com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">מְזִמּוֹתָיו</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 10:4\" href=\"/Psalms.10.4\">ψ 10:4</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  de <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>, seus <em>propósitos</em> <a data-ref=\"Job 42:2\" href=\"/Job.42.2\">Jb 42:2</a>; principalmente no castigo (cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, זָמַם\" href=\"/BDB,_זָמַם\", dir=\"rtl\">זָמַם</a>, <a data-ref=\"BDB, זִמָּה\" href=\"/BDB,_זִמָּה\", dir=\"rtl\">זִמָּה</a>) <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 23:20\" href=\"/Jeremiah.23.20\">Je 23:20</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 30:24\" href=\"/Jeremiah.30.24\">30:24</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 51:11\" href=\"/Jeremiah.51.11\">51:11</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">זמם</span> v. <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 51:12\" href=\"/Jeremiah.51.12\">12</a>).<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>capacidade de planejar, discernimento</em> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 1:4\" href=\"/Proverbs.1.4\">Pr 1:4</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">דַּעַת</span>), <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 2:11\" href=\"/Proverbs.2.11\">2:11</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּבוּנָה</span>), <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 3:21\" href=\"/Proverbs.3.21\">3:21</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">תֻּשִׁיָּה</span>), <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 5:2\" href=\"/Proverbs.5.2\">5:2</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">דַּעַת</span>); <span dir=\"rtl\">דַּעַת מְזִמּוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 8:12\" href=\"/Proverbs.8.12\">8:12</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong> <strong>a.</strong>  <em>pensamentos</em> malignos dos homens <a data-ref=\"Psalms 10:4\" href=\"/Psalms.10.4\">ψ 10:4</a>, <em>desígnios</em> malignos dos homens <a data-ref=\"Job 21:27\" href=\"/Job.21.27\">Jb 21:27</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מחשׁבות</span>), <a data-ref=\"Psalms 10:2\" href=\"/Psalms.10.2\">ψ 10:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 21:12\" href=\"/Psalms.21.12\">21:12</a> (ambos com <span dir=\"rtl\">חָשַׁב</span>. <strong>b.</strong>  <em>iniquidade</em> em ato <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 11:15\" href=\"/Jeremiah.11.15\">Je 11:15</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 37:7\" href=\"/Psalms.37.7\">ψ 37:7</a> (ambos com <span dir=\"rtl\">עָשָׂה</span>), <a data-ref=\"Psalms 139:20\" href=\"/Psalms.139.20\">139:20</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">לִמְזִמָּה</span> = <em>iniquamente;</em>—notem-se as expressões: <span dir=\"rtl\">אישׁ מְזִמּוֹת</span> <em>homem de</em> (<em>maus</em>) <em>desígnios</em> (ou <em>práticas</em>). <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 12:2\" href=\"/Proverbs.12.2\">Pr 12:2</a> (oposto a <span dir=\"rtl\">טוֹכ</span>) <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 14:17\" href=\"/Proverbs.14.17\">14:17</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">בַּעַל־מְזִמּוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 24:8\" href=\"/Proverbs.24.8\">Pr 24:8</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מְחַשֵּׁב לְהָרֵעַ</span>; ver <a data-ref=\"BDB, בַּעַל\" href=\"/BDB,_בַּעַל\", dir=\"rtl\">בַּעַל</a>).",
