      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">זְמָ֑ן</span></big>  <strong>substantivo masculino.</strong> (tardio) <strong>tempo determinado, tempo (</strong>árabe <span dir=\"rtl\">زَمَنٌ</span>, etiópico ዘመን: aramaico bíblico 𝔗 <span dir=\"rtl\">זְמַן</span>, mas siríaco <span dir=\"rtl\">ܙܰܒܢܳܐ</span>, mandaico <span dir=\"rtl\">זיבנא</span>, mandaico <span dir=\"rtl\">זבאן</span>, ver NöM <sup>152</sup>; sobre origem no persa antigo, ver aramaico bíblico samaritano <span dir=\"rtl\">ࠆࠁࠍ</span>, palmireno <span dir=\"rtl\">זבנא</span>, cf. Reckendorf<sup>ZMG 1888, 394</sup><strong>)</strong>—singular <span dir=\"rtl\">זְמָ֑ן</span> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 2:6\" href=\"/Nehemiah.2.6\">Ne 2:6</a> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 3:1\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.3.1\">Ec 3:1</a>; com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">וְכִזְמַנָּ֑ם</span> <a data-ref=\"Esther 9:27\" href=\"/Esther.9.27\">Est 9:27</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">בִּזְמַנֵּיהֶם</span> v. <a data-ref=\"Esther 9:31\" href=\"/Esther.9.31\">31</a> (sobre o dagexe, cf. Ges<sup>§ 20. 2. c</sup>).",
