      "html": "† I. <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">זמר</span>]</big></big>  <strong>verbo.</strong> somente <strong>Piel.</strong> fazer música em louvor a Deus <span dir=\"rtl\">(י׳)</span>, somente poético. <strong>(</strong>árabe <span dir=\"rtl\">زَمَرَ</span> <em>tocar flauta, tocar</em> um instrumento de cana; aramaico <span dir=\"rtl\">ܙܡܰܪ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">זַמֵּר</span> e derivados; etiópico ዘመረ nas conjugações derivadas; sobre um sentido original <em>murmurar, sussurrar</em>, cf. Hup<sup>ZKM iii, (1840) 394 ff. iv, 139 ff.</sup> <em>Id</em><sup>Psalm. Einl. § 7, 2</sup> De<sup>4</sup> sobre <a data-ref=\"Psalms 3\" href=\"/Psalms.3\">ψ 3</a><strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>Piel.</strong>  Imperfeito, 3.ª pessoa masculina singular com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">יְזַמֶּרְךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 30:13\" href=\"/Psalms.30.13\">ψ 30:13</a>; 1.ª pessoa singular <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲזַמֵּר</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 5:3\" href=\"/Judges.5.3\">Ju 5:3</a> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 22:50\" href=\"/II_Samuel.22.50\">2 S 22:50</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">(וַ)אֲזַמְּרָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 7:18\" href=\"/Psalms.7.18\">ψ 7:18</a> + 7 vezes;, <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲזַמֵּ֑רָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 18:50\" href=\"/Psalms.18.50\">ψ 18:50</a> + 3 vezes; com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲזַמֶּרְךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 57:10\" href=\"/Psalms.57.10\">ψ 57:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 108:4\" href=\"/Psalms.108.4\">108:4</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲזַמְּרֶ֑ךָּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 131:1\" href=\"/Psalms.131.1\">ψ 131:1</a>; 3.ª pessoa masculina plural <span dir=\"rtl\">יְזַמְּרוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 66:4\" href=\"/Psalms.66.4\">ψ 66:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 149:3\" href=\"/Psalms.149.3\">149:3</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וִיזַמְּרוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 66:4\" href=\"/Psalms.66.4\">ψ 66:4</a>; 1.ª pessoa plural <span dir=\"rtl\">נְזַמְּרָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 21:14\" href=\"/Psalms.21.14\">ψ 21:14</a>; imperativo masculino plural <span dir=\"rtl\">זַמְּרוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 9:12\" href=\"/Psalms.9.12\">ψ 9:12</a> + 14 vezes, <span dir=\"rtl\">זַמֵּ֑רוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 47:7\" href=\"/Psalms.47.7\">ψ 47:7</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; infinitivo <span dir=\"rtl\">לְזַמֵּר</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 92:2\" href=\"/Psalms.92.2\">ψ 92:2</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">זַמְּרָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 147:1\" href=\"/Psalms.147.1\">ψ 147:1</a>;—<em>fazer música, melodia</em> (somente Salmos, exceto <a data-ref=\"Judges 5:3\" href=\"/Judges.5.3\">Ju 5:3</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 12:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.12.5\">Is 12:5</a>);— <strong>1.</strong>  de <em>cantar</em> a <span dir=\"rtl\">(ל)</span> Deus (Javé) <a data-ref=\"Judges 5:3\" href=\"/Judges.5.3\">Ju 5:3</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 27:6\" href=\"/Psalms.27.6\">ψ 27:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 101:1\" href=\"/Psalms.101.1\">101:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 104:33\" href=\"/Psalms.104.33\">104:33</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 105:2\" href=\"/Psalms.105.2\">105:2</a> = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 16:9\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.16.9\">1 Ch 16:9</a> (todos ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁיר</span> verbo), <a data-ref=\"Psalms 30:5\" href=\"/Psalms.30.5\">ψ 30:5</a> (aqui ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">הוֹדוּ</span>), <a data-ref=\"Psalms 47:7\" href=\"/Psalms.47.7\">47:7</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(לְמַלְכֵּנוּ)</span>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 66:4\" href=\"/Psalms.66.4\">66:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 71:23\" href=\"/Psalms.71.23\">71:23</a> (com <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּרַנֵּנָּה שְׂפָתַי</span>), <a data-ref=\"Psalms 9:12\" href=\"/Psalms.9.12\">9:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 75:10\" href=\"/Psalms.75.10\">75:10</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">הגיד</span>), <a data-ref=\"Psalms 146:2\" href=\"/Psalms.146.2\">146:2</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">הלל</span>); seguido de <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶלִ־</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 59:1-8\" href=\"/Psalms.59.1-8\">59:1–8</a>, ao seu nome <span dir=\"rtl\">לשׁם</span>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 18:50\" href=\"/Psalms.18.50\">ψ 18:50</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 22:50\" href=\"/II_Samuel.22.50\">2 S 22:50</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אודך</span>), <a data-ref=\"Psalms 92:2\" href=\"/Psalms.92.2\">ψ 92:2</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">לְהֹדוֹת</span>), <a data-ref=\"Psalms 135:3\" href=\"/Psalms.135.3\">135:3</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">הללויה</span>); seguido de sufixo = <em>cantar a ti, louvar-te em canto</em> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 30:13\" href=\"/Psalms.30.13\">ψ 30:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 57:10\" href=\"/Psalms.57.10\">57:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 108:4\" href=\"/Psalms.108.4\">108:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 138:1\" href=\"/Psalms.138.1\">138:1</a> (todos ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אודך</span>); seguido de acusativo <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 12:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.12.5\">Is 12:5</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">אלהים</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 47:7\" href=\"/Psalms.47.7\">ψ 47:7</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">אלהינו</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 147:1\" href=\"/Psalms.147.1\">147:1</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">אדני</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 68:33\" href=\"/Psalms.68.33\">68:33</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁירו</span>), seguido de <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁמוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 7:18\" href=\"/Isaiah.7.18\">7:18</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אודה</span>), <a data-ref=\"Psalms 9:3\" href=\"/Psalms.9.3\">9:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 61:9\" href=\"/Psalms.61.9\">61:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 66:4\" href=\"/Psalms.66.4\">66:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 68:5\" href=\"/Psalms.68.5\">68:5</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁירו</span>); seguido de <span dir=\"rtl\">כְּבוֹד שְׁמוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 66:2\" href=\"/Psalms.66.2\">66:2</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">גבורתך</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 21:14\" href=\"/Psalms.21.14\">21:14</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">נשׁירה</span>); seguido de acusativo do cântico, <span dir=\"rtl\">מַשְׂכִּיל</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 47:8\" href=\"/Psalms.47.8\">ψ 47:8</a> (ver <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> sob <a data-ref=\"BDB, שָׂכַל\" href=\"/BDB,_שָׂכַל\", dir=\"rtl\">שׂכל</a>); absoluto <a data-ref=\"Psalms 57:8\" href=\"/Psalms.57.8\">57:8</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אשׁירה</span>), <a data-ref=\"Psalms 98:4\" href=\"/Psalms.98.4\">98:4</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">הָרִיעוּ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">פִּצְחוּ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">רַנֲנוּ</span>), <a data-ref=\"Psalms 108:2\" href=\"/Psalms.108.2\">108:2</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אשׁירה</span>; acompanhamento instrumental v. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 47:3\" href=\"/Psalms.47.3\">3</a>; cf. também v. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 47:4\" href=\"/Psalms.47.4\">4</a> acima), <a data-ref=\"Psalms 47:7\" href=\"/Psalms.47.7\">47:7</a><sup>(×2)</sup>. <strong>2.</strong>  de tocar instrumentos musicais <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּנֵבֶל עָשׂוֹר זַמְּרוּ־לוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 33:2\" href=\"/Psalms.33.2\">ψ 33:2</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">הודו לי׳ בְּכִנּוֹר</span>), cf. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 144:9\" href=\"/Psalms.144.9\">144:9</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אשׁירה</span>); <span dir=\"rtl\">אזמרה לך בכנור</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 71:22\" href=\"/Psalms.71.22\">71:22</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אודך בִכְלִי־נֶבֶל</span>); <span dir=\"rtl\">ז׳ לי׳ בכנ֑ור בכנור וקול זמרה</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 98:5\" href=\"/Psalms.98.5\">98:5</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">ז׳ לא׳ בכנור</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 147:7\" href=\"/Psalms.147.7\">147:7</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">ענו לי׳ בתודה</span>); <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּתֹף וכנור יזמרו־לו</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 149:3\" href=\"/Psalms.149.3\">149:3</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">יהללו שׁמו בְּמָחוֹל</span>).",
