      "html": "† I. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">זִמְרָה</span></big>  <strong>substantivo feminino: melodia, cântico</strong>, em louvor a <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>—absoluto <span dir=\"rtl\">ז׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 81:3\" href=\"/Psalms.81.3\">ψ 81:3</a> + 2 vezes; <span dir=\"rtl\">זִמְרָת</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 15:2\" href=\"/Exodus.15.2\">Ex 15:2</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 118:14\" href=\"/Psalms.118.14\">ψ 118:14</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 12:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.12.2\">Is 12:2</a>, leia-se <span dir=\"rtl\">זִמְרָתִ(י)</span> (ver Di Ex SS); construto <span dir=\"rtl\">זִמְרַת</span> <a data-ref=\"Amos 5:23\" href=\"/Amos.5.23\">Am 5:23</a>, sobre <a data-ref=\"Genesis 43:11\" href=\"/Genesis.43.11\">Gn 43:11</a> ver abaixo;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  de música instrumental <span dir=\"rtl\">וְזִמְרַת נְבָלֶיךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Amos 5:23\" href=\"/Amos.5.23\">Am 5:23</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">המון שִׁריך</span>).<br><strong>2.</strong>  de canto <span dir=\"rtl\">תּוֹדָה וקול ז׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 51:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.51.3\">Is 51:3</a>; como <em>tema</em> de cântico <span dir=\"rtl\">עֻזִּי וְזִמְרָתִי יָהּ</span> (assim se leia) <a data-ref=\"Exodus 15:2\" href=\"/Exodus.15.2\">Ex 15:2</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 12:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.12.2\">Is 12:2</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 118:14\" href=\"/Psalms.118.14\">ψ 118:14</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  não claramente determinado <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׂאוּ־ז׳ וּתְנוּ־תֹ֑ף כנור נעים עם־נָֽבֶל׃</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 81:3\" href=\"/Psalms.81.3\">ψ 81:3</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">בכנור וקול ז׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 98:5\" href=\"/Psalms.98.5\">98:5</a> (cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, זמר²\" href=\"/BDB,_זמר²\", dir=\"rtl\">III. זמר</a> no fim.).—Sobre <span dir=\"rtl\">מִזִּמְרַת הארץ</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 43:11\" href=\"/Genesis.43.11\">Gn 43:11</a> ver II. <a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, זִמְרָה²\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_זִמְרָה²\">זמרה</a> abaixo.",
