      "html": "† I. <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">זָמִיר</span>]</big>  <strong>substantivo masculino.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Isaiah 25:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.25.5\">Is 25:5</a></sup> <strong>cântico (</strong>cf. Ba<sup>NB 136</sup><strong>)</strong>—construto <span dir=\"rtl\">זְמִיר</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 25:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.25.5\">Is 25:5</a>; plural absoluto <span dir=\"rtl\">זְמִרוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 35:10\" href=\"/Job.35.10\">Jb 35:10</a> + 2 vezes, <span dir=\"rtl\">זְמִרֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 24:16\" href=\"/Isaiah.24.16\">Is 24:16</a>; construto <span dir=\"rtl\">זְמִרוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 23:1\" href=\"/II_Samuel.23.1\">2 S 23:1</a>;—<em>cântico</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">נְעִים זְמִרוֹת ישׂראל</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 23:1\" href=\"/II_Samuel.23.1\">2 S 23:1</a> em epíteto de Davi; <a data-ref=\"Job 35:10\" href=\"/Job.35.10\">Jb 35:10</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 24:16\" href=\"/Isaiah.24.16\">Is 24:16</a>; de cântico (hostil) de triunfo <span dir=\"rtl\">זְמִיר עָרִיצִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 25:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.25.5\">Is 25:5</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁאוֹן זָרִים</span>); cântico em louvor a <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳ בִּזְמִרוֹת נָרִיעָה לוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 95:2\" href=\"/Psalms.95.2\">ψ 95:2</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">תודה</span>), cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">ז׳ היו לי חֻקֶּיךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 119:54\" href=\"/Psalms.119.54\">119:54</a>, isto é, são o tema do meu cântico.—Sobre <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 2:12\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.2.12\">Ct 2:12</a> ver II. <a data-ref=\"BDB, זָמִיר²\" href=\"/BDB,_זָמִיר²\", dir=\"rtl\">זמיר</a> sob <a data-ref=\"BDB, זָמַר\" href=\"/BDB,_זָמַר\", dir=\"rtl\">II. זמר</a> acima.",
