      "preview": "מִזְמוֹר: melodia; designação técnica de salmos.",
      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מִזְמוֹר</span></big>  <strong>substantivo.</strong>[<strong>masculino.</strong>] <strong>melodia (</strong>designação técnica dos salmos; cf. Hup<sup>Psalm. Einl. § 7, 2</sup> De<sup>4</sup> sobre <a data-ref=\"Psalms 3\" href=\"/Psalms.3\">ψ 3</a>, Bae<sup>Psalmen, xiii</sup>; <span dir=\"rtl\">مَزَامِيرٌ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܡܰܙܡܘܽܖ</span>̈<span dir=\"rtl\">ܶܐ</span>, መዝሙር: empréstimos, todos = <em>salmo</em>(<em>s</em>); sobre <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span>, em relação a <span dir=\"rtl\">תהלה</span> cf. Lg<sup>Or ii. 22f.</sup><strong>)</strong>, sempre nesta forma; em 57 títulos de salmos:—<span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> sozinho <a data-ref=\"Psalms 98:1\" href=\"/Psalms.98.1\">ψ 98:1</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳ שׁיר ליום הַשַּׁבָּת</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 92:1\" href=\"/Psalms.92.1\">92:1</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳ לְתוֹדָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 100:1\" href=\"/Psalms.100.1\">100:1</a>; geralmente com nome de pessoa ou título; <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳ לְדָוִד</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 3:1\" href=\"/Psalms.3.1\">ψ 3:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 15:1\" href=\"/Psalms.15.1\">15:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 23:1\" href=\"/Psalms.23.1\">23:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 29:1\" href=\"/Psalms.29.1\">29:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 63:1\" href=\"/Psalms.63.1\">63:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 141:1\" href=\"/Psalms.141.1\">141:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 143:1\" href=\"/Psalms.143.1\">143:1</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁיר מ׳ לדוד</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 108:1\" href=\"/Psalms.108.1\">108:1</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳ לדוד לְהַזְכִּיר</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 38:1\" href=\"/Psalms.38.1\">38:1</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳ שִׁיר־חֲנֻכַּת הבית לדוד</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 30:1\" href=\"/Psalms.30.1\">30:1</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">לדוד מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 24:1\" href=\"/Psalms.24.1\">24:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 101:1\" href=\"/Psalms.101.1\">101:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 110:1\" href=\"/Psalms.110.1\">110:1</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">לַמְֿנַצֵּחַ מ׳ לדוד</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 13:1\" href=\"/Psalms.13.1\">13:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 19:1\" href=\"/Psalms.19.1\">19:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 20:1\" href=\"/Psalms.20.1\">20:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 21:1\" href=\"/Psalms.21.1\">21:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 31:1\" href=\"/Psalms.31.1\">31:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 41:1\" href=\"/Psalms.41.1\">41:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 51:1\" href=\"/Psalms.51.1\">51:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 64:1\" href=\"/Psalms.64.1\">64:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 140:1\" href=\"/Psalms.140.1\">140:1</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">לַמְֿנַצֵּחַ</span> … <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳ לדוד</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 4:1\" href=\"/Psalms.4.1\">4:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 5:1\" href=\"/Psalms.5.1\">5:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 6:1\" href=\"/Psalms.6.1\">6:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 8:1\" href=\"/Psalms.8.1\">8:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 9:1\" href=\"/Psalms.9.1\">9:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 12:1\" href=\"/Psalms.12.1\">12:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 22:1\" href=\"/Psalms.22.1\">22:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 39:1\" href=\"/Psalms.39.1\">39:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 62:1\" href=\"/Psalms.62.1\">62:1</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">לַמְֿנַצֵּחַ מ׳ לדוד שׁיר</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 65:1\" href=\"/Psalms.65.1\">65:1</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">למנצח לדוד מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 40:1\" href=\"/Psalms.40.1\">40:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 109:1\" href=\"/Psalms.109.1\">109:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 139:1\" href=\"/Psalms.139.1\">139:1</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">למנצח לדוד מ׳ שׁיר</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 68:1\" href=\"/Psalms.68.1\">68:1</a>; também simplesmente <span dir=\"rtl\">לַמְֿנַצֵּחַ מ׳ שׁיר</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 67:1\" href=\"/Psalms.67.1\">ψ 67:1</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">לַמְֿנַצֵּחַ שׁיר מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 66:1\" href=\"/Psalms.66.1\">66:1</a>; mas também <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁיר מ׳ לבני־קרח</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 48:1\" href=\"/Psalms.48.1\">ψ 48:1</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">לִבְנֵי־קֹרַח מ׳ שׁיר</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 87:1\" href=\"/Psalms.87.1\">87:1</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁיר מ׳ לבני קרח לַמְֿנַצֵּחַ</span> … <span dir=\"rtl\">מַשְׂכִּיל לְהֵימָן הָאֶזְרָחִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 88:1\" href=\"/Psalms.88.1\">88:1</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">לַמְֿנַצֵּחַ לבני־קרח מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 47:1\" href=\"/Psalms.47.1\">47:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 49:1\" href=\"/Psalms.49.1\">49:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 85:1\" href=\"/Psalms.85.1\">85:1</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">למנצח</span> … <span dir=\"rtl\">לבני־קרח מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 84:1\" href=\"/Psalms.84.1\">84:1</a>; além disso <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳ לְאָסָף</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 50:1\" href=\"/Psalms.50.1\">ψ 50:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 73:1\" href=\"/Psalms.73.1\">73:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 79:1\" href=\"/Psalms.79.1\">79:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 82:1\" href=\"/Psalms.82.1\">82:1</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁיר מ׳ לאסף</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 83:1\" href=\"/Psalms.83.1\">83:1</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">לַמְֿנַצֵּחַ</span> … <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳ לאסף שׁיר</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 75:1\" href=\"/Psalms.75.1\">75:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 76:1\" href=\"/Psalms.76.1\">76:1</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">לַמְֿנַצֵּחַ</span> … <span dir=\"rtl\">לאסף מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 77:1\" href=\"/Psalms.77.1\">77:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 80:1\" href=\"/Psalms.80.1\">80:1</a>. [Resumo:—<span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> em 34 salmos com <span dir=\"rtl\">לַמְֿנַצֵּחַ</span>, dos quais 23 têm também <span dir=\"rtl\">לדוד</span>, 5 também <span dir=\"rtl\">לבני קרח</span>, 4 <span dir=\"rtl\">לאסף</span>, e 2 sem nome próprio; além disso, em 13 salmos com <span dir=\"rtl\">לדוד</span>, 2 com <span dir=\"rtl\">לבני קרח</span>, 5 com <span dir=\"rtl\">לאסף</span>; em somente 3 sem nome próprio nem título; <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> é precedido de <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁיר</span> 5 vezes, e seguido de <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׁיר</span> 8 vezes]",
