      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">זָנָב</span></big>  <strong>substantivo masculino.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Judges 15:4\" href=\"/Judges.15.4\">Ju 15:4</a></sup> <strong>cauda</strong>, também (figuradamente) <strong>extremidade, toco (</strong>hebraico novo <em>idem</em>, assírio <em>zibbatu</em> Hom<sup>NS 368</sup>, etiópico ዘነብ árabe <span dir=\"rtl\">ذَنَبٌ</span>, aramaico <span dir=\"rtl\">ܕܽܘܢܒܳܐ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">דּוּנְבָּא</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">דַּנְבָּא</span><strong>)</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">ז׳</span> absoluto <a data-ref=\"Judges 15:4\" href=\"/Judges.15.4\">Ju 15:4</a><sup>(×2)</sup> + 5 vezes; com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">זְנָבוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 40:17\" href=\"/Job.40.17\">Jb 40:17</a>; plural <span dir=\"rtl\">זְנָבוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 15:4\" href=\"/Judges.15.4\">Ju 15:4</a>; construto <span dir=\"rtl\">זַנְבוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 7:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.7.4\">Is 7:4</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong> <strong>a.</strong>  <em>cauda</em> de raposa <a data-ref=\"Judges 15:4\" href=\"/Judges.15.4\">Ju 15:4</a><sup>(×3)</sup>, de serpente <a data-ref=\"Exodus 4:4\" href=\"/Exodus.4.4\">Ex 4:4</a> (J), de hipopótamo <a data-ref=\"Job 40:17\" href=\"/Job.40.17\">Jb 40:17</a>; <strong>b.</strong>  figuradamente do povo comum, em oposição aos governantes <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 9:13\" href=\"/Isaiah.9.13\">Is 9:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 19:15\" href=\"/Isaiah.19.15\">19:15</a> (em ambos, <span dir=\"rtl\">רֹאשׁ וְזָנָב</span>, ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">כִּפָּה וְאַגְמוֹן</span>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 9:14\" href=\"/Isaiah.9.14\">Is 9:14</a> é glosa incorreta); de povo subjugado (oposto a <span dir=\"rtl\">רֹאשׁ</span>) <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 28:13\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.28.13\">Dt 28:13</a>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 28:44\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.28.44\">44</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>extremidade, toco</em> (de tição, <span dir=\"rtl\">אוּד</span>) em metáfora <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 7:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.7.4\">Is 7:4</a>.",
