      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">זְנוּת</span></big>  <strong>substantivo feminino abstrato: fornicação</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">ז׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 4:11\" href=\"/Hosea.4.11\">Ho 4:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Hosea 6:10\" href=\"/Hosea.6.10\">6:10</a>; com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">זְנוּתֵךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 13:27\" href=\"/Jeremiah.13.27\">Je 13:27</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 23:27\" href=\"/Ezekiel.23.27\">Ez 23:27</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">זְנוּתָהּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 3:9\" href=\"/Jeremiah.3.9\">Je 3:9</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">זְנוּתָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 43:7\" href=\"/Ezekiel.43.7\">Ez 43:7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 43:9\" href=\"/Ezekiel.43.9\">9</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">זְנוּתַיִךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 3:2\" href=\"/Jeremiah.3.2\">Je 3:2</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">זְנוּתֵיכֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 14:33\" href=\"/Numbers.14.33\">Nu 14:33</a>.<br><strong>a.</strong>  sexual <a data-ref=\"Hosea 4:11\" href=\"/Hosea.4.11\">Ho 4:11</a>.<br><strong>b.</strong>  internacional <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 23:27\" href=\"/Ezekiel.23.27\">Ez 23:27</a>.<br><strong>c.</strong>  religiosa <a data-ref=\"Numbers 14:33\" href=\"/Numbers.14.33\">Nu 14:33</a> (J) <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 3:2\" href=\"/Jeremiah.3.2\">Je 3:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 3:9\" href=\"/Jeremiah.3.9\">9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 13:27\" href=\"/Jeremiah.13.27\">13:27</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 43:7\" href=\"/Ezekiel.43.7\">Ez 43:7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 43:9\" href=\"/Ezekiel.43.9\">9</a> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 6:10\" href=\"/Hosea.6.10\">Ho 6:10</a> (onde We<sup>Kl. Proph.</sup> sugere <span dir=\"rtl\">זָנִיתָ</span>); cf. <a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, זָנָה\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_זָנָה\">זָנָה</a> <strong>3.</strong>",
